*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : PAY0006
*> PURPOSE : PAYROLL DEDUCTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-07-16 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-10-07 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 609
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PAYNIGHT STEP090
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAY0006.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    *> EMPLOYEE TYPE F=FULL-TIME P=PART-TIME C=CONTRACTOR
    05 EMP-CLASS          PIC X.
       88 EMP-FULL-TIME VALUE 'F'.
    *> HOURS WORKED THIS WEEK
    05 WEEK-HOURS         PIC 9(3).
    *> PENSION ENROLMENT Y/N
    05 PENSION-OPTIN      PIC X.
    *> YEARS OF SERVICE
    05 YRS-SERVICE        PIC 9(2).
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 BENEFIT-IND        PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    *> PENSION CONTRIBUTION RATE
    05 PENSION-RATE       PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM BENEFIT-ELIG
    PERFORM PENSION-CONTRIB
    DISPLAY "BENEFIT-IND=" BENEFIT-IND
    DISPLAY "PENSION-RATE=" PENSION-RATE
    STOP RUN.
BENEFIT-ELIG.
    *> BENEFITS ELIGIBILITY
    IF EMP-FULL-TIME
       OR (EMP-CLASS = 'P' AND WEEK-HOURS >= 30)
        MOVE 'Y' TO BENEFIT-IND
    END-IF.
PENSION-CONTRIB.
    *> PENSION CONTRIBUTION RATE
    IF PENSION-OPTIN = 'Y' AND YRS-SERVICE >= 3
        MOVE 0.0500 TO PENSION-RATE
    ELSE
        MOVE 0.0200 TO PENSION-RATE
    END-IF.
